om\/blog\/data-engineer-roadmap\/#faq-question-1768307384857\",\"position\":4,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/data-engineer-roadmap\/#faq-question-1768307384857\",\"name\":\"4. How long does it take to follow a data engineer learning roadmap?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Following a data engineer career roadmap usually takes 6 to 18 months, depending on your background. If you already know programming or databases, you progress faster. With consistent practice, projects, and learning core tools, you can become job-ready within this time.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/data-engineer-roadmap\/#faq-question-1768307402984\",\"position\":5,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/data-engineer-roadmap\/#faq-question-1768307402984\",\"name\":\"5. Do I need coding skills to become a data engineer?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes, coding skills are important to become a data engineer. Programming languages like Python and SQL are used to build data pipelines, process data, automate tasks, and work with databases and cloud-based data systems.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/data-engineer-roadmap\/#faq-question-1768307424438\",\"position\":6,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/data-engineer-roadmap\/#faq-question-1768307424438\",\"name\":\"6. Is cloud computing important in the roadmap for data engineer?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Cloud computing is very important in a roadmap for data engineer because most data systems run on cloud platforms. You use cloud services to store, process, and scale large volumes of data easily.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.c